OL,3,GNEWSALevelling the playing field for
OL,4,Athose with disabilities
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrowing up Aoibheann struggled to find
OL,7,Fa sports club to join.
OL,9,FNow, she plays boccia, a game designed
OL,10,Ffor those with disabilities, and is
OL,11,Fbeating several of her classmates.
OL,13,FDad Ethan said the "opportunity for
OL,14,FAoibheann to have something of her own
OL,15,Fto do, that's just for her" makes such
OL,16,Fa difference.
OL,18,FThe pair were taking part in a Junior
OL,19,FParalympic fun day aimed at showcasing
OL,20,Fseveral sports for those with a
OL,21,Fphysical disability.
